                                                "sense_id": "11fad7a9-136e-3f2b-97df-8d1422e7ab44",
                                                "text": "It is a special day for you indeed, for both of us, bodies incorporeal, receptive always to life's joys appreciative in any way I can, you like to remind me were both getting old; I'd remind you that, at fifty-five, you're still a spring chicken."
